      ],
      "text": "For autonomous modes (/lavra-work-ralph, /lavra-work-teams), the docs recommend a granular allow list in .claude/settings.json (git, bd, test runners, Read/Write/Edit/Grep/Glob) rather than --dangerously-skip-permissions, which bypasses all approval prompts globally."
    },
