  "summary": "Selected evidence records: Lavra is a plugin for coding agents that orchestrates the development lifecycle from brainstorming to shipping while automatically capturing and recalling knowledge so each unit of work makes the next easier. The product exposes slash commands: a four-command pipeline (/lavra-design, /lavra-work, /lavra-qa, /lavra-ship) plus supporting commands like /lavra-quick, /lavra-learn, /lavra-recall and power-user commands /lavra-work-ralph and /lavra-work-teams.",
  "superseded_claim_ids": []
